# store/.canonical -- THE CANONICAL-STORE MARKER (schema v1.2, [B10]).
#
# Its presence is what makes this tree the canonical store: pcrecbench/store.py
# refuses to WRITE a `tier: scratch` record into a store carrying this file,
# and refuses to INDEX one that somehow got here. A store without the marker
# is a scratch store. The marker is a file rather than a path comparison so
# it holds from a worktree, whose store/ is a checkout of this same tree.
canonical
